"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[90476],{90476:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/open_darkness.png\\"\\n          title=\\"Open Darkness\\"\\n          author=\\"Renjo Mikihiko\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Momo\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2022-12-21\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9791192579313\\"\\n          rating=3.5\\n          tags=\\"mystery\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nI started reading this book after being impressed by <mark>Renjo Mikihiko</mark>\'s ```7-in-1 Role``` and wanting to explore more of his work.  \\nI didn\'t realize it was a short story collection, so I spent a lot of effort taking notes on all the characters as I read. I was a bit disappointed when I realized they were short stories...  \\n<br>\\nThey were typical Japanese mystery novels focused on finding motives and tricks.  \\nHowever, the collection was full of short stories that evoked the same intense curiosity about the tricks as ```7-in-1 Role``` did.  \\n"}')}}]);